   "text": "Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.\n\nThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself.",
